  {
    "id": 2013012030170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『昨日の夜、お父さんたちと喧嘩してた』って……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そこが？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私は、両親と喧嘩なんて\r\nほとんどしたことが無いから",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "台本を貰って、読んだ時\r\nどんな感じなのかしら……って思ったのよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！\r\nそうだったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "もちろん、映画やドラマで\r\nそういうシーンを見たことはあるし",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "想像はつくわよ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だけど、もし自分が本当にそうなった時\r\nそんな気持ちになるのか…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、実際に同じようなことを経験している方が\r\nやりやすいかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "お芝居って、こんなにも\r\n自分が経験してきたことが糧になるのね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……もちろん、両親と喧嘩をした方が\r\nいいっていう訳ではないけれど",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030250,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私はもっと色々な経験を積まないといけないって\r\n……考えさせられたわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "この仕事も\r\nいい経験になったな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "芝居だけじゃ\r\nないかもな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "これからもっと\r\n経験を積んでいこう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことが、考えられたならさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030260,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、そうね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030270,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "こうやって……芸能の活動を通して",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030280,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "普通じゃ経験できないことを\r\nたくさん経験させてもらえているんだから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030290,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……その経験をちゃんと\r\nこれからに活かしていかないといけないわ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな\r\nそうしてもらえたら嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……すごく",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色々な経験が活きてくるっていうのはさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルをするのだって\r\nプロデューサーをするのだって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "多分、これまでの色々な経験が\r\n活きてくるはずだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030300,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……そうね、そう思うわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030310,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "全てのことが繋がって\r\n私を作ってくれているんだもの",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030320,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だからきっと、もっと\r\n良い私になっていけるはずよね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030320"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺にできることがあれば\r\n何でも言ってくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013012030330,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ふふ、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301203/2013012030330"
  },
